---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Page title="Editorial standards" description={`How ${SITE.name} reports, checks, labels and corrects its stories.`} updated="15 November 2026">
  <p>These are the rules {SITE.name} works to. They apply to every story we publish.</p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy and sources</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We check facts against published sources: company statements and filings, regulators, official statistics, court and tribunal orders, and reporting by established news organisations.</li>
    <li>We name or link our sources wherever we can, so readers can check them.</li>
    <li>We separate what is confirmed from what is alleged or reported, and we say so in the story.</li>
    <li>Quotes are reproduced as published. We do not invent quotes or sources.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="independence">Independence</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Advertisers and partners have no say in what we report.</li>
    <li>Press releases and sponsored content are published in the Press Releases section or clearly labelled, and are not presented as our own reporting.</li>
    <li>We explain business and markets. We do not give investment advice. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="images">Images</h2>
  <p>We use photographs we have the right to publish, such as freely licensed and stock images, and we credit them where the licence asks for it. Pictures used for illustration are chosen to match the subject of the story.</p>

  <h2 id="corrections">Corrections</h2>
  <p>If we get something wrong, we fix it as quickly as we can and add a note to the article saying what changed. Significant updates are shown with an "Updated" date at the top of the story.</p>

  <h2 id="feedback">Feedback and complaints</h2>
  <p>To report an error or raise a concern about a story, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with the article link and what you think needs fixing. We read every message and aim to reply within two working days.</p>

  <h2 id="ownership">Who we are</h2>
  <p>{SITE.name} is an independent website. It is not affiliated with Business Today, the India Today Group, or any other publication or media group with a similar name. Read more on our <a href="/about/">About</a> page.</p>
</Page>
